Custom command discovery uses explicit trusted roots and an environment-bound
process backend. Shared command factories publish ordinary Durable registrations.

The component provisions Deno 2.9.7 on first runtime use. Deno is MIT licensed.
No Deno executable is included in this npm package. Platform archive and
executable checksums and sizes are retained from the source revision.

